{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32011","headline":"观冬设上东川杨尚书 · 贾岛","name":"观冬设上东川杨尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"匏革奏冬非独乐，军城未晓啓重门。\n何时却入三台贵，此日空知八座尊。\n罗绮舞中收雨点，貔貅阃外卷云根。\n逐迁属吏随宾列，拨櫂扁舟不忘恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}